OL,3,GNEWSACharity creates school kits for
OL,4,Aabuse victims' kids
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has put together 60 backpacks
OL,7,Ffilled with back-to-school essentials
OL,8,Ffor children who have been affected by
OL,9,Fdomestic abuse.
OL,11,FThe Haven Wolverhampton said its scheme
OL,12,Fprovided items such as water bottles,
OL,13,Fstationery and an Asda voucher towards
OL,14,Fbuying uniforms.
OL,16,FIt was made possible following a recent
OL,17,Fappeal that saw donations pour in from
OL,18,Fthe community and local businesses.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
