OL,3,GNEWSACharity creates school kits for
OL,4,Aabuse victims' kids
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We can provide every school-age child
OL,7,Fwho is currently living in our safe
OL,8,Faccommodation with what they need to
OL,9,Fstart school feeling more confident,
OL,10,Fand like many of their peers, with the
OL,11,Fnecessities ready to learn," Anna
OL,12,FPendlebury, the charity's head of
OL,13,Ffundraising and engagement.
